OL,3,GNEWSAEMR warns passengers 'may not be
OL,4,Aable to board'
OL,5,
OL,6,FEast Midlands Railway (EMR) has warned
OL,7,Fpassengers should carry out "essential
OL,8,Ftravel only" over the Bank Holiday due
OL,9,Fto strike action.
OL,11,FThe operator said it will have a
OL,12,F"significantly reduced" service on
OL,13,FSunday and Monday, with a queueing
OL,14,Fsystem for boarding at London St
OL,15,FPancras and Sheffield. It warned "it
OL,16,Fmay not be possible to board your
OL,17,Fintended service".
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
