OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1787720139
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAEMR warns passengers 'may not be
OL,4,Aable to board'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Rail, Maritime and Transport (RMT)
OL,7,Funion has been in dispute with EMR
OL,8,Fsince April over the rollout of the
OL,9,FAurora (Class 810 fleet), which it said
OL,10,Fhad operated with a "significant
OL,11,Fnumber" of faults.
OL,13,FAfter industrial action on three
OL,14,FSaturdays in August, it announced more
OL,15,Fstrikes while what EMR called
OL,16,F"constructive discussions" continued.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
